# Carried, and not yet read by anything. The fight keeps the player's HP (see
# fight.h) and hands a slice of it back on every respawn beat, so there is a
# place for this to land -- but the recovery, the party it is shared with and
# the cooldown the party shortens are one feature, and none of it is written.
# GMS's figure is 15% a level over 20; this is the same 300% in half the steps.
#
# What keeps the levels from being wasted meanwhile is Invincible, which waits
# on five of them exactly as it does in GMS.
name: "Heal"
skill_order: 3
description: "Calls down a warm light that closes your wounds."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
tags: SKILL_TAG_BENEVOLENCE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_CLERIC
max_level: 10
